    <p style={{ color: "var(--muted)", fontSize: "0.95rem", lineHeight: 1.75, maxWidth: "820px", margin: "0.75rem 0 1.25rem" }}>
      The Udemy voucher is the cheapest standard way to buy these exams, but it is not always the best deal. The Linux Foundation runs its own seasonal promotions and sells training bundles that Udemy does not.
